      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KEPIL (1) was in the money last time at this track (17.99) in a Grade 5, finishing a one length third. Has already won out of this draw. Looks suited and should go close. TICKET MAN (4) was fast away from wide out with an impressive early sectional and went on to clock 22.55 in a 0.8 lengths win at Gosford over 388m. The form out of his last race has been franked. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. ADDISON BANNER (2) has a strong overall record having five wins and eight places from 18 starts including a last start second (17.92) over 324m at this track. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. FLIEGEN (5) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
